    "title": "Strong 1st inning lifts HCA past Dawson Springs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joe Wilson ,\n17 hours ago Heritage Christian Academy scored 19 runs in the first inning and cruised past visiting Dawson Springs 21-4 Tuesday afternoon in a three-inning baseball game. The Warriors took advantage of nine Panthers’ errors and seven walks to score their most runs in a game since a win over Warren Central of May, 2024. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
